<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Each moment and instance by God is assigned,</l><l>Fulfilling our purpose to gain our rich Christ.</l><l>Anxiety from Satan in us has no ground.</l><l>We live Christ to others, in Him we’ll be found.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Forbearance from God is a Person so dear.</l><l>By prayer and petition our burdens He hears.</l><l>Be anxious in nothing, with thanks we must pray,</l><l>And speak with the Lord, this is the secret way.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In God’s life there’s rest and enjoyment and peace,</l><l>For fear and anxiety in us now has ceased.</l><l>Continually speaking with Christ, He’s so near.</l><l>He’s ready to help us, His presence so dear.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
